revision.text:
== About == This is a list of cosmetics that may need to have their names changed based on their texture file names. It's better to avoid fan-made terms where possible, and cosmetics are a big part of the game.
Clothing category would need renaming since the files refer to them as "Fit" and not "Clothing".
We will discuss and eventually reach out to Aggro Crab to collect their input on which names they prefer.
